Cell["\<\
The answer is block diagonal matrix, whereas  the initial matrix was not. It \
is obvious that full matrix can\[CloseCurlyQuote]t be represented in basis of \
block diagonal matrices.  The same case occur for all algebras, which has \
block diagonal representation in Bott table.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->CompressedData["
1:eJxTTMoPSmViYGAQBmIQnV+6VEYz/rVj+LlnyiD65TxHBxD9dCevE4iuVL6a
