Cell[TextData[{
 "We are warned that factorized algebra Cl[2,1]->Cl[1,0]\[CircleTimes]Cl[1,2] \
contains Cl[1,0] algebra. In these cases we can reduce dimension of \
representation if complex matrices are allowed.  To find smaller \
representations of initial algebra Cl[2,1]  instead we use Cl[1,2] algebra \
(option ",
 StyleBox["BaseVectorAlgebra\[Rule]\[NoBreak]Cl[1,2,0]",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\[NoBreak]) and multiply all obtained base vectors representations by \
imaginary unit. This will give representation of original Cl[2,1]. Indeed"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.673770213170585*^9, 3.673770271212688*^9}, {
